{"id":"40c0018b6d45300e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-formulas.md","title":"Formulas and Derived Connectives in the Book","display":"df-smullyan-formulas — Formulas and Derived Connectives in the Book","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-formulas"],"display":"df-smullyan-formulas — Formulas and Derived Connectives in the Book","source":"第 II 章 pp. 15–17；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 32–34、57）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-terms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-formulas"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-formulas</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-formulas — Formulas and Derived Connectives in the Book"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 15–17；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 32–34、57）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"742319eca99c7bd5\" href=\"?note=742319eca99c7bd5\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-terms\">92-df-smullyan-terms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\)</span> 与原书造项运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"742319eca99c7bd5\" href=\"?note=742319eca99c7bd5\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-terms\">92-df-smullyan-terms</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{1,2\\}\">\\(J=\\{1,2\\}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{1,2,3\\}\">\\(J=\\{1,2,3\\}\\)</span>；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_E,\\operatorname{imp}_E,\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}\">\\(\\neg_E,\\operatorname{imp}_E,\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}\\)</span> 是造串构造器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\)</span> 是 Assertion 引入的新集合名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\mathtt{=}t,&amp;\n\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\mathord{\\leq}t,\\\\\n\\neg_E F&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathord{\\sim}F,&amp;\n\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\mathord{\\supset}H\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E F,&amp;\n\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t),\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\{\n\\neg_E F,\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H),\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)\\}\\subseteq U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fml}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2\\}},\\\\\nF\\lor_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(\\neg_E F,H),&amp;\nF\\land_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,\\neg_E H),\\\\\nF\\leftrightarrow_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)\\land_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(H,F),&amp;\n\\exists_E v_i^E F&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(\\neg_E F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\mathtt{=}t,&amp;\n\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq s\\mathord{\\leq}t,\\\\\n\\neg_E F&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathord{\\sim}F,&amp;\n\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\mathord{\\supset}H\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E F,&amp;\n\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t),\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\{\n\\neg_E F,\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H),\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)\\}\\subseteq U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fml}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2\\}},\\\\\nF\\lor_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(\\neg_E F,H),&amp;\nF\\land_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,\\neg_E H),\\\\\nF\\leftrightarrow_E H&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)\\land_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(H,F),&amp;\n\\exists_E v_i^E F&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(\\neg_E F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书原子公式既有等式也有原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 都须按上式展开。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\supset H\">\\(F\\supset H\\)</span> 就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)\\)</span>。原子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 本身没有额外外括号；蕴涵和二元函数应用有括号。不得用本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> 的不同 token 文法替换这些定义。</p>\n<p>最小闭包由集合交得到。完整项/公式树可按构造作结构归纳，保证以下自由变量、实例化与真值的递归良基。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-terms","status":"resolved","id":"742319eca99c7bd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-terms","status":"resolved","id":"742319eca99c7bd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}$ 与原书造项运算见 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{1,2,3\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_E,\\operatorname{imp}_E,\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Fml}_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t)&\\coloneqq s\\mathtt{=}t,&\n\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t)&\\coloneqq s\\mathord{\\leq}t,\\\\\n\\neg_E F&\\coloneqq\\mathord{\\sim}F,&\n\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)&\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\mathord{\\supset}H\\mathtt{)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_i^E F,&\n\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{eq}_E(s,t),\\operatorname{le}_E(s,t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_E^{<\\omega}\\mid\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\forall i\\geq1\\;\\{\n\\neg_E F,\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H),\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(F)\\}\\subseteq U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_E&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&\n\\mathrm{Fml}_A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,\\{1,2\\}},\\\\\nF\\lor_E H&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(\\neg_E F,H),&\nF\\land_E H&\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,\\neg_E H),\\\\\nF\\leftrightarrow_E H&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)\\land_E\\operatorname{imp}_E(H,F),&\n\\exists_E v_i^E F&\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{all}_{E,i}(\\neg_E F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"F\\supset H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}_E(F,H)","display":false},{"tex":"s=t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2367,"backlinks":[{"id":"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$v_1=v_1^E,v_2=v_2^E,0=\\nu_0^E,1=\\nu_1^E$；所有算术和逻辑符号是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 的显示缩写。"},{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"2897638221489da5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 arithmetic formula 在 L_E 中排除指数函数名，仍有原始 ≤。本文使用仅等式的 G 语言；原书的无指数公式集是 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] 中 Fml_A。指数关系可算术表达依赖 [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]，不由“去掉一个符号”的定义推出。"},{"id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书的原子公式还有原始 ≤，且等式外部不添本地的原子外括号；见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。本文的纯等式原子集只属于本地 G。"},{"id":"6785ab5b9adf7eb7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地语言把 ∧、∨、∃ 当原始构造。原书仅以否定、蕴涵和全称造公式，其它联结词须展开；原书最小闭包见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。"},{"id":"267c2162514e6e43","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E$，$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E$，$i\\geq1$；原书原始公式构造器见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。"},{"id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t,s$ 为原书项，$F,H$ 为原书公式，$i\\geq1$；构造器见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书语法与公理：[[92-df-smullyan-terms]] → [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] → [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]] → [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]] → [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]"}],"outgoing":["742319eca99c7bd5"]}